title: Standoff
text: A pinwheel must be lit in its own colour and no other: a red beam spoils a green pinwheel. Turn each beam aside after its own pinwheel, before it reaches the other one.
trick: colours must match; keep each beam off the other's target
motif: two lasers facing each other
---
